  <emphasis>proactivity</emphasis>.</para>
<para>Here are some tips to try during this lesson:</para>
<list>
  <item> <link url="https://characterlab.org/tips-of-the-week/all-together-now/">All Together Now</link> </item>
  <item> <link url="https://characterlab.org/tips-of-the-week/guided-mastery/">Guided Mastery</link> </item>
</list>
<para>You can find other tips located here in the <link url="https://characterlab.org/playbooks/proactivity/">Playbook on Proactivity</link> from Character Lab.</para></section>
